 "coaching_points": [
  "Warm up 2-3 min \u2014 light jogging, open-close hips, easy defensive shuffles and toe-taps on the ball",
  "How it works \u2014 carrier (from the far side) drives at Presser A; the instant A engages, Presser B sprints across to trap. Carrier tries to escape through either back gate; pressers try to win it or pen him in",
  "Presser A closes on the carrier's front foot and shows him ONE way \u2014 never square, always angled to steer him toward the waiting cover",
  "Presser B reads A's angle and slams the escape door \u2014 arrive as A engages so the trap springs simultaneously, not late",
  "Read the carrier's hips and touch \u2014 jockey until his head drops, then B steps in to win it; stay on your feet, no lunging or sliding",
  "A press succeeds if the pair wins the ball OR pins the carrier \u22653 seconds without a foul \u2014 aim for 6 of 10 attempts",
  "10 attacks per set, 3 sets; the carrier collecting and resetting to the far side is your rest between reps",
  "Progression \u2014 carrier gets a free 5m head start; regression \u2014 narrow the gates so the trap is easier to spring"
 ],
 "variations": [
  "Silent press \u2014 pressers communicate only with body angle, no shouting, to sharpen scanning",
  "Swap roles every 5 attacks so all three train the pair-press trap"
 ],
